<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Tooth falls into loss for 1995/96 yr.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Tooth falls into loss for 1995/96 yr.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     5.85 vs  16.10</p>
<p>    Net				 loss 3.98 vs profit 1.18</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)		nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Sales				     nil vs 200.35</p>
<p>    Other income			  28.84 vs  35.18</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			loss 3.2 vs profit 0.9</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  loss 9.83 vs loss 5.88</p>
<p>    Tax					 nil vs   1.30</p>
<p>    Interest				 7.38 vs  20.08</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  0.002 vs   7.58</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs   7.74</p>
<p>NOTE: Tooth &amp; Co Ltd is part of the Adelaide Steamship Co Ltd group of companies. The results are reported on a consolidated economic entity basis. Tooth said the abnormal loss reflected the provision of diminution of loans related entities.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
